$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=encnat5len  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for the example: the length of encodeNat 5 is 3.

s1::5nn |- 5 e. NN
i2::encnatlenn
s3:s1,i2:ax-mp |- ( # ` ( encodeNat ` 5 ) ) = ( ( |_ ` ( 2 logb 5 ) ) + 1 )
s4::encnat5lem1 |- ( |_ ` ( 2 logb 5 ) ) = 2
s5:s4:oveq1i |- ( ( |_ ` ( 2 logb 5 ) ) + 1 ) = ( 2 + 1 )
s6::2p1e3 |- ( 2 + 1 ) = 3
s7:s5,s6:eqtri |- ( ( |_ ` ( 2 logb 5 ) ) + 1 ) = 3
qed:s3,s7:eqtri |- ( # ` ( encodeNat ` 5 ) ) = 3
